    "why": "the chain's field names are transcript field names. The event stream spells the same idea differently, so a chain keyed on the transcript spelling drops every assistant record it sees there — and it does that silently, on a one-character difference. Downstream of conversion nothing survives at all: the canonical Message keeps only role and content.",
